<div class="page">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
        <div style="width: 45%;">
            <div class="section-title">What You Need to Know About FERPA</div>
            <p>What is FERPA? (Also known as ACCESS BGSU): FERPA is a federal law designed to protect the privacy of student educational records. FERPA allows students to control who sees their personal information. In accordance with FERPA, BGSU is required to have the students' permission in order to release financial information.</p>

            <div class="sub-heading">Why should a student submit a FERPA release?</div>
            <p>FERPA release allows any content the student delegates to view and discuss account details including:</p>
            <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li class="list-item"><span data-field="ferpa_detail_1">{{ ferpa_detail_1 }}</span></li>
                <li class="list-item"><span data-field="ferpa_detail_2">{{ ferpa_detail_2 }}</span></li>
                <li class="list-item"><span data-field="ferpa_detail_3">{{ ferpa_detail_3 }}</span></li>
            </ul>

            <div class="sub-heading">How can I authorize FERPA for a contact?</div>
            <p>Here's how to view your bill:</p>
            <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li class="list-item"><span data-field="ferpa_contact_step_1">{{ ferpa_contact_step_1 }}</span></li>
                <li class="list-item"><span data-field="ferpa_contact_step_2">{{ ferpa_contact_step_2 }}</span></li>
                <li class="list-item"><span data-field="ferpa_contact_step_3">{{ ferpa_contact_step_3 }}</span></li>
                <li class="list-item"><span data-field="ferpa_contact_step_4">{{ ferpa_contact_step_4 }}</span></li>
            </ul>

