            </ul>

            <div class="sub-heading">Paying your bill:</div>
            <p>Methods of Payment:</p>
            <p><span data-field="payment_method_1">{{ payment_method_1 }}</span>, <span data-field="payment_method_2">{{ payment_method_2 }}</span>, <span data-field="payment_method_3">{{ payment_method_3 }}</span>, <span data-field="payment_method_4">{{ payment_method_4 }}</span>, <span data-field="payment_method_5">{{ payment_method_5 }}</span>, and <span data-field="payment_method_6">{{ payment_method_6 }}</span>.</p>
            <p>A non-refundable convenience fee will be assessed.</p>
            <p>Make checks, money orders, or bank checks payable to Bowling Green State University and send to:</p>
            <p><span data-field="mailing_address_1">{{ mailing_address_1 }}</span><br>
            <span data-field="mailing_address_2">{{ mailing_address_2 }}</span></p>
            <p>Please include the student's BGSU identification number on the check.</p>
        </div>
