            <div class="section-title">BGSU Offers a Payment Plan:</div>
            <p>Bowling Green State University offers a payment plan to help students and families manage the cost of educational expenses.</p>

            <div class="sub-heading">Installment Payment Plan</div>
            <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li class="list-item"><span data-field="installment_step_1">{{ installment_step_1 }}</span></li>
                <li class="list-item"><span data-field="installment_step_2">{{ installment_step_2 }}</span></li>
