            </ul>
            <p>Ensure you enroll before the semester due date to maximize the number of installments and benefit of this plan.</p>

            <div class="sub-heading">Here's how to enroll in the Installment Payment Plan:</div>
            <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li class="list-item"><span data-field="installment_enroll_step_1">{{ installment_enroll_step_1 }}</span></li>
                <li class="list-item"><span data-field="installment_enroll_step_2">{{ installment_enroll_step_2 }}</span></li>
                <li class="list-item"><span data-field="installment_enroll_step_3">{{ installment_enroll_step_3 }}</span></li>
                <li class="list-item"><span data-field="installment_enroll_step_4">{{ installment_enroll_step_4 }}</span></li>
            </ul>
            <p>Select the Installment Payment Plan and follow the prompts to complete the enrollment.</p>

            <div class="sub-heading">Late Payment/Fee/Service Charges</div>
            <p>A late payment fee will be put on your bill in an installment payment plan by the due date. This policy also applies to occupancy in residence halls. If you fail to pay your balance, BGSU reserves the right to take action against your account, including but not limited to: suspension of student class registration, on-campus housing and dining/meal plans.</p>

            <div class="sub-heading">Payment Policy</div>
            <p>A late payment fee will be put on your bill in an installment payment plan by the due date. This policy also applies to occupancy in residence halls. If you fail to pay your balance, BGSU reserves the right to take action against your account, including but not limited to: suspension of student class registration, on-campus housing and dining/meal plans.</p>
